@startuml j7-clinic-file-edit
!include c4-sequence.iuml
title J7 Editing the clinic file
actor "Staff" as Staff <<person>>
box "In the staff browser"
participant "Staff page\n(staff/staff.js,\nstaff/form.js,\nshared.js)" as SP <<container>>
participant "Rules engine\n(core.js, in\neach browser)" as Core <<component>>
end box
box "Vercel functions"
participant "api/clinic.js" as Clinic <<container>>
end box
database "Postgres\n(Neon)" as Store <<store>>
box "In the patient's browser"
participant "Patient chat on\nany device\n(chat.js, shared.js)" as Chat <<container>>
end box
actor "Patient" as Patient <<person>>

== Saving a change ==
Staff -> SP : changes a value under\n"Edit with a form" or in\nthe JSON box, then presses\n"Save clinic file"
SP -> Core : FD.validateClinic,\nthen FD.saveClinic
Core --> SP : the file is in use\nin the staff browser
SP -> Clinic : shared.js: POST /api/clinic\n(the file, with the desk code)
Clinic -> Clinic : checks the desk code,\nthen the shape of the file
alt the code and the file are right
  Clinic -> Store : the one row of\nthe table clinic_data
  Clinic --> SP : 200
  SP --> Staff : "Saved for every device.\nThe chat answers from this\nfile from the very next question."
else wrong code (401) or a bad file (400)
  note over SP, Clinic : nothing is saved on the server;\nthe page says why
end
== The next question ==
Patient -> Chat : asks a question
Chat -> Clinic : shared.js: GET /api/clinic\n(the answer waits\ntwo seconds at most)
Clinic -> Store : read the saved file
Clinic --> Chat : the saved file
Chat -> Core : FD.saveClinic, then\nFD.answer from the new file
Chat --> Patient : the answer holds\nthe new value
note over Core, Chat : the chat answers from the file it holds\nwhen the server is slower than two seconds
== Back to the original ==
opt the staff member presses "Use the original file"
  Staff -> SP : presses "Use the\noriginal file"
  SP -> Clinic : shared.js: POST /api/clinic\n(reset, with the desk code)
  Clinic -> Store : the saved row\nis deleted
  SP --> Staff : "Back to the original\nclinic file, on every device."
end
@enduml
